  "notes": "legacy_scripts live in static/ and are served from /static/<name>; everything else lives in static/v2/ and is served from /static/v2/<name>. Load order = legacy_scripts then scripts. The offline package inlines legacy_scripts + scripts minus offline_exclude, and styles. 'generated' files are served only through their own routes (/v2/example), never through /static/v2/."
